  "prefLabel": "Ath 103.03 Responsibilities of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ath 103.03 Responsibilities of the Board. The board's responsibilities include:\n\n(a) Establishing the eligibility requirements for initial licensure pursuant to RSA 328-F:11, I(a);\n\n(b) Establishing the eligibility requirements for license renewal, including any continuing competency requirements, and any requirements for education, clinical experience, and training pursuant to RSA 328-F:11(b); and\n\n(c) Regulating the profession of athletic training.\n\nSource. #8345, eff 5-7-05; ss by #12946, eff 12-20-19 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ath 100); ss by #14373, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ath100-500.html"
